      <p>We prioritize financial transparency and rapid diagnostic delivery. Clear package pricing means upfront pricing for individual tests and bundled male fertility hormone profiles, and the team confirms the exact amount when you book.</p>
      <div class="tw"><table>
        <thead><tr><th>Service</th><th>Price</th><th>What it includes</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>{prices.map(r => <tr><th scope="row">{r[0]}</th><td><b>{r[1]}</b></td><td>{r[2]}</td></tr>)}</tbody>
      </table></div>
      <p class="note"><b>24-Hour Digital Delivery:</b> complete hormone reports are dispatched within 24 hours via secure digital channels or WhatsApp for review during your consultation.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="related">
      <h2>Related Fertility Tests &amp; Male Fertility Care</h2>
